+Feature: Application serves from project root index.html
+  As a user opening the app in a web browser
+  I want the app to serve from a real index.html at the project root
+  So that the app renders and runs in a browser
+
+  Rule: index.html must exist as a real file at the project root
+
+  Scenario: index.html exists at the project root and loads the app script
+    Given the project root
+    When I list the project root files
+    Then the file "index.html" exists at the project root
+    And "index.html" contains a script element with src "js/app.js"
+    And "index.html" contains the new-todo input element
+    And "index.html" contains a section with class "main"
+    And "index.html" contains a footer with class "footer"
